Dry Gulch — credits & licences

ORIGINAL (made for this film, by code in this folder)
- All pixel art: KID and BLACK HAT (code rig + hand-placed ASCII heads/hats), portraits, eye close-ups, the town,
  mesas, tumbleweed, title card, UI windows. (cowboy.js, scenes.js, main.js)
- Music: original chiptune synthesised with numpy (mix.py). All melodies original.
